# Build context for the root Dockerfile — the Glama/MCP distribution image.
#
# That Dockerfile COPYs exactly backend/pyproject.toml, backend/README.md,
# backend/LICENSE and backend/src. Everything else here is upload weight, and
# `.env` is the one that matters: a later edit that widens the COPY to the whole
# context must not be able to bake local credentials into a published image.
.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
frontend
site
docs
specs
harness
scripts
infra
tests
backend/tests
backend/coverage.xml
backend/uv.lock
.env
.env.*
*.pdf
*.log
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
